Bipartisan momentum is already building in the Senate to create a federal film tax incentive.  

 @SenatorTimScott and I already have a full 10% of the Senate signed on, just days after the introduction of our bill — with support now from @SteveDaines, @SenatorWarnock, @JohnCornyn, @SenAlexPadilla, @TimSheehyMT, @MarkWarner, @berniemoreno, @SenatorAndyKim.  

These Senators agree: We must take action to stop the ever-growing exodus of TV and film production leaving the United States for other countries.

